    "text": "The reaction is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>→</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>33.58</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced cl